  {"on": "checkpoint:1", "who": "mags", "line": "Blue panels: wallrun one, then jump to kick off to the next. That's a wall hop."},
  {"on": "objective:1", "who": "host", "line": "Lookouts! Say hello to the man of the hour."},
  {"on": "objective:1", "who": "mags", "line": "Three gunners. Watch for the red laser: that's a shot coming, so move. Click the mouse wheel when it gets busy: time slows for a few seconds. Use it."},
  {"on": "done:1", "who": "host", "line": "Oh, he shoots too. Echo, darling, you never mentioned that."},
  {"on": "objective:2", "who": "mags", "line": "That mast is their relay. Get past it and you're out of their sight. Wall on your left this time."},
  {"on": "complete", "who": "host", "line": "He's quick, folks! Quicker than my last three couriers, may they rest in pieces."},
  {"on": "complete", "who": "host", "line": "Stay tuned. Next on the show: the Glass District, where the windows are sharp and my toll collectors are sharper."},
  {"on": "complete", "who": "mags", "line": "Ignore him. Catch your breath, then we go."}
